  itemId: gitem_cockpit
  displayName: Cockpit
  description: 'A seated cockpit with two shells to choose from: arm the crawler
    nose or the survey cab on the build wheel and the block you place wears it. Three
    displays across the dash, a console low enough to glance at, and glass down to
    the sill. Requires 50 W idle power; if the cockpit or grid power is offline,
    flight controls are disabled.'
